{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46899","headline":"寄澧阳吴使君 · 齐己","name":"寄澧阳吴使君","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"南客西来话使君，涔阳风雨变行春。\n四邻耕钓趋仁政，千里烟花压路尘。\n去兽未胜除狡吏，还珠争似复逋民。\n红兰浦暖携才子，烂醉连题赋白苹。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46899.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46899","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}